Package: quarBreach
Title: Explore COVID-19 Quarantine Breach Risk via the Zachreson (2022) Model
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Urvi", "Joshi", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "ujoshi@student.monash.edu")
Description: Provides datasets and an interactive Shiny app for exploring how
    vaccine efficacy, community vaccination coverage, and the basic reproduction
    number interact to determine quarantine breach risk and time to a community
    outbreak. Data are reconstructed from Zachreson et al. (2022)
    <doi:10.1126/sciadv.abm3624>.
